	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダム00』よりガンダムデュナメスがついに完全新規造形でMGに登場！",
			"• GNスナイパーライフルのスタンドを展開し、本体を地面に伏せた「狙撃」の構えも再現可能。",
			"• スナイプポーズの動きに対応した頭部ギミック、脚部関節構造により緊張感が漂うポージングを再現できる。",
			"• GNフル・シールドの展開を再現。",
			"• 腰部・膝部のミサイル・信号弾のハッチ開閉やGNスラスターの展開ギミックなどMGならではのギミックを搭載"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM 00\" GUNDAM Dynames finally appears in MG in a completely new model!",
			"• The stand of the GN sniper rifle can be unfolded, and the \"sniping\" stance with the main body face down on the ground can also be reproduced.",
			"• The head gimmick that corresponds to the movement of the snipe pose and the leg joint structure can reproduce poses with a sense of tension.",
			"• Reproduced the deployment of the GN Full Shield.",
			"• Equipped with gimmicks unique to MG, such as opening and closing the hatches of missiles and signal bullets in the waist and knees, and the deployment gimmick of the GN thruster."
		]
	},
